        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda yaayongera okulagira Musa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akobere Abaisiraeli ati: “Bwe mulituuka mu nsi Musengwa Katonda y'abagha ni mukungula engaano, ekinhwa ekisooka mukitwalanga wa kabona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anaakighangayo ng'akiwuuba mu maiso ga Musengwa Katonda, olwo Musengwa Katonda oyo yaakisiima. Kabona anaakighangayo ku lunaku olwiririra Sabbato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era ku lunaku lwe munaagheerangayo ekinhwa ky'engaano ekyo, munaaghangayo eri Musengwa Katonda entaama enume ento ng'ekigheebwayo ekyokebwa, ng'eziraku kikyamu kyonakyona, era nga ya mwaka mulala gwonka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era ku kigheebwayo ekyo, munaagheerangaku kilo ibiri edh'obuwunga obuseereibwa obukalamu era obutabwirwamu omuzigo ogw'emiti emyoliva, ng'ekigheebwayo eky'eby'okulya. Akawoowo ak'ekigheebwayo ekyo kasangaaza Musengwa Katonda. Era munaaghangayo lita ndala ey'omwenge ogw'emizabbibu, ng'ekigheebwayo eky'ebyokunhwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutalyanga ku ngaano mpyaka naire, k'ebe nga mbisi, oba nga nkalange, oba ng'ekoleibwamu omugaati, okutuusa nga mumaze okuleeta ekigheebwayo kya Katonda waimwe. Eiteeka lino linaakuumibwanga ab'olulyo lwaimwe boonaboona, enaku dhoonadhoona, buli ye banaabanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Munaabalanga wiiki musanvu okuva ku lunaku olwiririra Sabbato eyo lwe muleeteireku ekinhwa kyaimwe eky'engaano okukighaayo eri Musengwa Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.23.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 23:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.34.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "34:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.9+DEU.16.10+DEU.16.11+DEU.16.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ma 16:9-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lunaku olwamakumi ataanu olwiririra Sabbato eyomusanvu, munaaghangayo eri Musengwa Katonda ekigheebwayo ekindi eky'emere ey'empeke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli maka ganaaleetanga emigaati ebiri eri Musengwa Katonda ng'ekigheebwayo ekiwuubibwa. Buli mugaati gunaakolebwanga mu kilo ibiri edh'obuwunga obuseereibwa obukalamu, nga butabwirwamu ekizimbulukusa. Emigaati egyo munaagighangayo eri Musengwa Katonda ng'ekigheebwayo eky'ebirime ebisooka okukungula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aghalala n'emigaati egyo, munaaghangayo entaama musanvu edh'omwaka omulala omulala, n'ente enume ento ndala, n'entaama enume enkulu ibiri; dhoonadhoona tidhiibengaku kikyamu kyonakyona. Dhinaagheebwangayo eri Musengwa Katonda ng'ekigheebwayo ekyokebwa, ghalala n'ekigheebwayo eky'emere ey'empeke, n'eky'ebyokunhwa. Akawoowo ak'ekigheebwayo ekyo kasangaaza Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era munaaghangayo embuzi enume ndala, ng'ekigheebwayo olw'ebibi, n'entaama ento ibiri edh'omwaka omulala omulala, ng'ekigheebwayo eky'okutabagana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.19",
