            "sid": "LEV 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabona anaaghangayo eri Musengwa Katonda emigaati gire ghalala n'entaama, ng'ekigheebwayo ekiwuubibwa, ekiba ekya bakabona. Ebigheebwayo ebyo bitukuvu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lunaku olwo munaalangiriranga, mwesoloza okunsinza. Mutakolanga mulimo waire omulala ku egyo gye mukola buliidho. Eiteeka lino munaalikuumanga ebyanda n'ebyanda, mu nse dhoonadhoona, eyo yoonayoona ye munaabanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
