          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bwe munaabanga mukungula ebirime byaimwe, mutamalirangayo irala ebisembayo ku mbibi dh'enimiro dhaimwe. Oba okwirayo einhuma okulonderera ebyo ebiba bisigaireyo. Ebyo byonabyona mubirekerenga abaavu n'abasenze. Ninze Musengwa Katonda waimwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
