              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.13+DEU.16.14+DEU.16.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ma 16:13-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kobera Abaisiraeli ati olweikumi n'eitaanu olw'omwezi ogwo ogwomusanvu, ghanaabangagho Ekibinuko eky'Entindi ekikolerwa Musengwa Katonda, okumala enaku musanvu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lunaku olusooka ku edho omusanvu, muneesolozanga okusinza, era mutakolanga mulimo waire omulala ku egyo gye mukola buliidho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli lunaku, mu nnaku edho omusanvu, munaaghangayo ekigheebwayo ekyokebwa. Ku lunaku olwomunaana, muneesolozanga okusinza, era mwaghaayo ekigheebwayo ekyokebwa. Lunaabanga lunaku lukologho lwa kusinza, era mutakolanga mulimo waire omulala ku egyo gye mukola buliidho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Edho n'enaku edh'okukolerangaku embaga edh'ebibinuko Musengwa Katonda dh'alagiire, dhe munaalangiriranga okwesoloza okusinza n'okughaayo eri Musengwa Katonda ebigheebwayo ebyokebwa, ebigheebwayo eby'emere ey'empeke, emisengo, n'ebigheebwayo eby'okunhwa, buli kirala mu biseera byakyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebibinuko ebyo n'ebyeyongeire ku Sabbato dha Musengwa Katonda edhabuliidho. Era ebigheebwayo ebyo n'ebyeyongeire ku byabuliidho, bye mughaayo eri Musengwa Katonda olw'okutuukiriza obweyamo, ni bye mughaayo eby'ekyeyendere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bwe munaamalanga okukungula ebirime byaimwe, munaakuzanga ekibinuko kino, okumala enaku musanvu, nga mutoolera n'olunaku olweikumi n'eitaanu olw'omwezi ogwomusanvu. Ku lunaku olusooka ni ku lusembayo, ghanaabangagho okuwuumulira irala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lunaku olwo olusooka, munaatwalanga ku bibala eby'emiti gyaimwe ebisinga bulungi. Munaatwalanga ensaga edh'emiti eminaazi, n'ensaga edh'emiti egy'amakaba amangi, n'obuti obukulira ku mbali kw'omwiga, memale mwasagamba okumala enaku musanvu, nga musaaka Musengwa Katonda waimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munaakuzanga ekibinuko kino okumala enaku musanvu buli mwaka. Eiteeka eryo munaalikuumanga ebyanda n'ebyanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisiraeli mwenamwena munaabanga mu ntindi okumala enaku musanvu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "olwo Abaisiraeli ab'omu nse edhiriiragho bamanhe ng'Abaisiraeli abaabasooka nabaleetera okusula mu ntindi, bwe nabatoola e Misiri. Ninze Musengwa Katonda waimwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
